Phase 6 — Observability

In: OTel traces on /v1/payments, Prom histograms, outbox lag, lease reclaim count, 409 rate.
Out: Treating 99.9% as a contractual SLO.
Done when: p95 latency is measured, not guessed.

Implementation: GET /metrics scrapes a per-process Prometheus registry.
authorize records decision/intent/model histograms, 409 conflicts, lease
reclaims, and outbox lag. /ready exposes measured p95_decision_ms.
Compose runs Prometheus and Grafana with four local-SLO dashboards.
99.9% remains a demo-window target, not a contract.
